              Project Mercury
            </span>
          </div>
          <div className="flex items-center justify-center opacity-0 animate-fade-in-up">
            <img src="/images/logo.svg" alt="Mercury" className="h-28 lg:h-36 w-auto" />
          </div>
          <p className="text-lg text-[#86868b] leading-relaxed mb-10 max-w-[440px] mx-auto opacity-0 animate-fade-in-delayed">
